<title>INDIA: Bombay stocks-recent FII equity trading volumes.</title>
<headline>Bombay stocks-recent FII equity trading volumes.</headline>
<dateline>BOMBAY 1997-02-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Latest turnover figures for purchases and sales of shares on the Bombay bourse by foreign institutional investors (FIIs) are as follows:</p>
<p>			     (in million rupees)</p>
<p>			 on Feb 3, 1997   total to date since FIIs</p>
<p>						 began trading in 1993</p>
<p> Purchases		    100		    159,370</p>
<p> Sales			  220		     65,420</p>
<p> Net			   -120		     93,950</p>
<p>------------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p>			     (in million rupees)</p>
<p>			 on Feb 4, 1997   total to date since FIIs</p>
<p>						 began trading in 1993</p>
<p> Purchases		     60		    159,430</p>
<p> Sales			  150		     65,570</p>
<p> Net			    -90		     93,860</p>
<p>Note : The above FII figures are provisional</p>
<p>Source: Bombay Stock Exchange</p>
<p>-- Bombay newsroom +91-22-265 9000</p>
</text>
